{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/DVS06904-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<p>陳朗昇今日下午到法院前開 live 說：「以我粗淺認知，高院輪咗要入去（入獄），我都有心理打算。他指自己的心情忐忑複雜。他表示，當日「攞張身份證出嚟攞遲咗」，採訪受阻撓。他今日身穿印有 Press Freedom 的黑衫入法院。他表示，希望自己是最後一個因採訪工作被警察截查而惹官非的記者。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/DVS06839-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/DVS06777-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/DVS06579-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/DVS07000-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\">\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-29T06:39:14.234526+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":6,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}